<title>DENMARK: Sweden issues 500 mln Dkk 4 pct 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden issues 500 mln Dkk 4 pct 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Carnegie Bank on Friday.</p>
<p>BORROWER - Kingdom of Sweden.</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Carnegie Bank.</p>
<p>AMOUNT   - 500 MLN DKK.</p>
<p>MATURITY - 2002.</p>
<p>COUPON   - 4 pct LAST MOODY AAA</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P - AAA</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
